<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sign in to RaivMC</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#0d0e12] text-white font-sans min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">

    <div class="bg-[#14161f] p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl max-w-md w-full text-center border border-orange-500/20 relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-500 to-amber-600 rounded-2xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-orange-500/30">
            🔥
        </div> 

        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-3 text-orange-400">Sign in to RavixMC</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mb-8 leading-relaxed">You need a Discord account to apply. We only read your username and avatar.</p>

        <a href="/auth/discord" class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-[#5865F2] hover:bg-[#4752C4] text-white py-3.5 px-6 rounded-xl font-bold transition duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20">
           Login with Discord
        </a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
